<item><title>Tunisia opts for a separate financial structure for postal bank</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-opts-for-a-separate-financial-structure-for-postal-ea1de7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-opts-for-a-separate-financial-structure-for-postal-ea1de7/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The proposed entity would offer easier-term banking services to some social groups without converting the postal service into a conventional bank.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:45:52 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Pasteur Institute of Tunis starts amphitheatre renovation</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/pasteur-institute-of-tunis-starts-amphitheatre-renovation-1e796c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/pasteur-institute-of-tunis-starts-amphitheatre-renovation-1e796c/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>Backed by the Dr Sadok Besrour Foundation and Unesco, the work will upgrade audiovisual systems, ventilation and accessibility while preserving the building’s character.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:20:18 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tunisia&apos;s sports minister unveils football reform after two decades of failings</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-s-sports-minister-unveils-football-reform-after-two-209152/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-s-sports-minister-unveils-football-reform-after-two-209152/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>Sadok Mourali outlined a long-term overhaul of youth training, elite funding and stadium repairs after MPs demanded the football federation&apos;s board step down.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:46:05 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tunisia forecasts overnight storms in the far North-West</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-forecasts-overnight-storms-in-the-far-north-west-49ddd7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-forecasts-overnight-storms-in-the-far-north-west-49ddd7/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The meteorological institute expects daytime highs of 26°C to 31°C across most regions, reaching 33°C locally in the Centre.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:36:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tunisia&apos;s finance committee approves seven water project bills</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-s-finance-committee-approves-seven-water-project-2293c8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-s-finance-committee-approves-seven-water-project-2293c8/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The bills cover loans, guarantees and additional financing for projects to strengthen water resources and upgrade drinking-water infrastructure.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:11:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-s-finance-committee-approves-seven-water-project-2293c8/share.jpg" length="41883" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-s-finance-committee-approves-seven-water-project-2293c8/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
